<title>USA: Friedman sets five pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Friedman sets five pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Friedman Industries Inc said Tuesday its board of directors had declared a five percent stock dividend on its common stock.</p>
<p>Friedman said the board will pay the dividend on May 23 to shareholders of record as of April 25.</p>
<p>The board also declared a regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.06 per share to be paid on May 23 to holders of record on April 25, it said.</p>
</text>
